Strategy account ban risk
title end

paragraph start
Platforms can limit or remove an account without warning. Risk factors are rule breaks, copied content, fast repeated actions on a new account and unlicensed music.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Response: follow the platform rules pages, warm up new accounts slowly, keep a backup of all content and have the appeal steps ready.
paragraph end

